        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QLewds</strong> is an upcoming Free-to-Play 3 vs 3 online multiplayer clash in a large 2D arena. The game aims to bridge aspects of MOBAs, Metroidvanias, 2D Platformers, and Brawlers into a novel gaming experience. The game has just entered Early Access and its beta phase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is achieved for one team by destroying the enemy's <strong>throne</strong>. <strong>Thrones </strong>are invulnerable until the opposing team collects enough Ether. Ether is gained in a variety of ways, including destroying enemy team's <strong>flowers, killing enemy players, and other unique in game objects. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is split between day and night cycles. During daytime players can focus on the <strong>lanes</strong>, where the <strong>flowers </strong>are active. At night the game opens up, with the flowers sleeping and neutral enemies spawning throughout the map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically, you begin the game weak and pathetic. Through superior performance you end a match like a boss by leveling up,  earning gold, buying upgraded skills, passive upgrades, and active upgrades, beating scary bosses, making sick plays, discovering hidden secrets, sniping some queeps, laughing at a scrub, and probably some other stuff. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a game, have fun, sorry about the lava.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for supporting independent game development &lt;3</p>",
